[00:17.950]I don't want nobody to get killed
{"我不想任何人丧命"}
[00:25.220]I'll come and get you
{"我会来接你"}
[00:26.260]I am always ready to fight
{"我时刻准备战斗"}
[00:31.640]So don't take all of the blame we were all swept away
{"别把过错全揽身上　我们都被浪潮卷走"}
[00:36.080]Don't take all of the weight.You always do
{"别总把重担独扛　你总是这样"}
[00:39.780]There will always be something you cannot control
{"总有些事你无法掌控"}
[00:43.260]We will overcome.Your salvation has begun
{"我们会渡过难关　你的救赎已经开始"}
[00:48.400]No signs,no lights
{"没有信号　没有光亮"}
[00:50.260]Such a mess all over
{"到处都一团糟"}
[00:53.830]Don't kill your hopes
{"别扼杀你的希望"}
[00:56.070]You make me realize who I need
{"你让我看清自己需要谁"}
[01:01.580]I'll be there hold on
{"我会赶到　坚持住"}
[01:04.120]They'll change you somehow
{"他们总会改变你"}
[01:06.150]So where are you now?
{"所以你现在何处？"}
[01:09.230]I'll reach you by dawn
{"我将在黎明前找到你"}
[01:11.910]Before you can be turned
{"在你被转化之前"}
[01:14.030]Illusions are torn
{"幻象已被撕碎"}
[01:17.620]The fallen angels you run with don't know
{"与你同行的堕落天使并不知晓"}
[01:20.980]It is the pain that makes us all human after all
{"终究是痛苦让我们保有人的温度"}
[01:24.880]Warm old sepia photographs show
{"泛黄的老照片映照出"}
[01:28.520]Our fragile precious world
{"我们脆弱而珍贵的世界"}
[01:30.630]Must protect it,respond to the call
{"必须守护它　响应这召唤"}
[01:50.530]Are they really deep inside your head?
{"它们真的深植你脑海吗？"}
[01:57.810]Do they control you like a little marionette?
{"像操纵木偶般控制着你吗？"}
[02:04.700]I'll cut the strings off you dead.Come in with me
{"我会斩断你身上的提线　跟我来"}
[02:08.340]Let me free the wings of your soul.Can make it fly
{"让我释放你灵魂的翅膀　它能带你翱翔"}
[02:12.260]We've been waiting here just to make you whole again
{"我们在此守候　只为让你重获完整"}
[02:15.760]No more hating see I have always been your friend
{"别再怨恨　看啊我一直是你的挚友"}
[02:20.820]No signs,no lights
{"没有信号　没有光亮"}
[02:23.220]Such a mess all over
{"混乱四处蔓延"}
[02:26.100]Don't kill your hopes
{"别扼杀你的希望"}
[02:28.560]You make me realize who I need
{"你让我看清自己所需"}
[02:34.470]I'll be there hold on
{"我会在那里　坚持住"}
[02:36.500]They'll change you somehow
{"他们终将改变你"}
[02:38.620]So where are you now?
{"此刻你身在何方"}
[02:42.140]I'll reach you by dawn
{"我将在黎明前找到你"}
[02:44.460]The shadows appear
{"阴影逐渐显现"}
[02:46.710]Illusions are born
{"幻象开始滋生"}
[02:50.330]The fallen angels you run with don't know
{"与你同行的堕落天使并不知晓"}
[02:53.650]It is our pain that makes us all human after all
{"正是这份痛楚让我们终究成为凡人"}
[02:57.410]Torn old sepia photographs show
{"泛黄的老照片揭示着"}
[03:01.290]Our fragile precious world
{"我们脆弱而珍贵的世界"}
[03:03.130]Must discard it ,respond to the call
{"必须舍弃过往　响应召唤"}
[03:35.060]If you wanna fight with me
{"若你想与我并肩作战"}
[03:38.600]Then go ahead fight with me
{"那就来吧与我共同抗争"}
[03:42.350]Cos all I wanna do is help you man
{"因为我只想帮助你啊兄弟"}
[03:46.130]You will be the death of me
{"你终将成为我的终结"}
[03:51.010]The power of our army has been cut with a scythe
{"我们军团的力量已被镰刀斩断"}
[03:54.510]And if we lose you to them we may never survive
{"若你被他们夺走　我们可能全军覆没"}
[03:58.140]You can leave but you must first believe
{"你可以离开　但首先要坚信"}
[04:00.640]Just one step at a time and keep your head up boy and
{"只需一次一步 昂首向前 男孩"}
[04:04.190]You'll be free
{"你终将自由"}
